    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Modekai kūgūngūhiwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būjikū wa lūshikū lwenūlo ū ntemi yūtala ī tūlo, na lūūlū ūlagīja enhelwe ī shitabo sha mihayo ya shikū ja kū numa, ūsomelwa ī ya kajīle ka būsugi bokwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gūbonwa mo mhayo go ng'wa Modekai gwandīkilwe, gīkī akakulūla mbisīla ya ba Bigisana na Teleshi, abo baalī batūmami ba ntemi, balang'hani ba ha nyango; ūmo baalī basīīganīla kūhaya kūmūlaga ū ntemi Ahasuelo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū ntemi ūbūūja, “Ū Modekai ng'wenūyū akīītīlwa mhayo kī ū gwikūjo na koolecha kūnūmba?” A batūmami bakwe būnshokeja balīhaya, “Ataalī kwītīlwa mhayo gose gose.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho ū ntemi ūbūūja, “Alīho nani ū ng'wibīndo?” Ū Hamani ūsangwa hū oshika dūhū ū ng'wibīndo lya hanze, ī lya numba y'ikūlū. Wizaga kūhooya nū ntemi mhayo gwa kūnungeleja Modekai ha ngamba ūyo walī wagūsīmbīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū ntūmami wa ntemi ūhaya, “Alīho Hamani wīmīīlaga ng'wibīndo.” Ū ntemi ūhaya, “Ng'wīlage ize ūmu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wingīla ū Hamani, ū ntemi ūmūja, “Ī gīsī ng'hana, ū munhū ūyo ntemi atogilwe kūnkūja, ūlībona ūlū kwītīlwa mhayo kī?” Ū Hamani wiganika aliwīla, “Alīho nani ūngī ūyo adūgije kūkūjiwa na ntemi ūūkanikīla na nene?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Hamani ūnshokeja ū ntemi alīhaya, “Ū munhū ūyo ntemi atogilwe kūnkūja, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ni enhelagwe ng'hanjo y'ikūjo lya nyatemi, īyo wabīta kwīzwala ū ntemi, nī falasa īyo wīdamhīla ū ntemi, hama ītūūlīlwe na ngikili ya nyatemi a ha ntwe gwayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ī ng'hanjo yenīyo nī falasa inhwe ū ngong'ho gong'ho ūyo asanyiwe no no no na ntemi. Hama ū munhū ūyo ntemi atogilwe kūnkūja banzwalīkīje ī ng'hanjo ī y'ikūjo, hūna bandamhīje a ha falasa yenīyo; baje bakwītongeelaga ū mu mabbalabbla ga mu nzengo, kūnū bakūhamukaga ū kū būtongi bokwe būhaya, ‘Ū munhū ūyo ntemi atogilwe kūnkūja akwītīlwa gīkī!’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū ntemi ūng'wīla, “Gīko odala jigi; jaga wangū ūkasole ī ng'hanjo nī falasa. Ū Modekai ū Nyudaya, ūyo igashije ha gwalugwa ya ha ng'wa ntemi, ūng'wītīle gīt'ūmo wahayīla, gūtizūleba ho mhayo nūūlū gūmò ū mu yose īyo wīhaya yenīyī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana ū Hamani ūsola ī ng'hanjo nī falasa, ūnzwalīkīja ū Modekai, hūna ūntongeela ū mu mabbalabbala ga mu nzengo adamhīlile ī falasa; kūnū akūhamukaga ū kū būtongi bokwe alīhaya, “Ū munhū ūyo ntemi atogilwe kūnkūja akwītīlwa gīkī!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho ū Modekai ūshoka hangī a ha mita gwa ha ng'wa ntemi. Ū Hamani ū ng'wene wihuuta kūshoka kū ng'wakwe, wagookaga kīngī nasho, wiyinamīlaga ūūkikundīkīja nū ntwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho washika ūng'wīla ū nke wakwe ū Zeledi, na a banwani biye; wīhaya pyī īyo īkang'wilongela yenīyo. Hūna a baganikīji bakwe nū nke wakwe būng'wīla, “Ū Modekai ng'wenūyū, ūyo wandyaga kūgwa kū būtongi bokwe ūlū Nyudaya, ūtūdūla ū kwilwisha nang'hwe ū bebe, ūkūlabūka dūhū ū kū būtongi bokwe!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bataalī būyomba nang'hwe, kwimanīla biza basoloolwa ba ha ng'wa ntemi kūnsola ū Hamani, būng'wihuutya kūja ū kū shigukulu īsho Esita walī washibeeja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
